## Done looks like

A deliverable is done when the exported PDF/PPTX/DOCX is in `deliverables/YYYY-MM-slug/`, the index README has the row (what, sent to, notes) and the repo STATE.md records the send.

## What NOT to do

- Do not edit deliverables here; rebuild in the repo and re-export.
- Do not copy `received/` material into the repo.
- Do not file plans, runbooks or technical research here: they belong in `<repo>/.iago/`.

